{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-colours-at-the-market","version":1,"title":"Colours at the Market (a colour rhyme)","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Red, red, red are the tomatoes in a heap.\nPile them up high, but not too steep.","sentences":["Red, red, red are the tomatoes in a heap.","Pile them up high, but not too steep."],"alt":"A neat heap of red tomatoes at a stall.","image":{"hash":"sha256:2b61b7b03d5a426ce1f22acf41be85b898768eec22cb102ec5aedc772609439b","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:edb4825c7532b93242671d00f17abbc871f22d2f732f8678b6654b83e31eedc9","durationMs":9520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4866],[4866,9520]],"words":[[0,635],[635,1269],[1269,1692],[1692,2116],[2116,2539],[2539,3667],[3667,3949],[3949,4090],[4090,4866],[4866,5430],[5430,5994],[5994,6276],[6276,7052],[7052,7475],[7475,7898],[7898,8321],[8321,9520]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Yellow, yellow, bananas in a bunch.\nPeel one slowly for a tasty lunch.","sentences":["Yellow, yellow, bananas in a bunch.","Peel one slowly for a tasty lunch."],"alt":"A bunch of yellow bananas.","image":{"hash":"sha256:43ba4c6a0c94369cfaa9e84864fe341413c36d12bfd25aa25080a8fdb79a7bf4","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:47e3b050f3ec7b33dd441ea92fa4ca84ae5d8754bcb43388c5753a537b76c4c6","durationMs":9640,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4898],[4898,9640]],"words":[[0,1166],[1166,2332],[2332,3421],[3421,3732],[3732,3887],[3887,4898],[4898,5520],[5520,5986],[5986,6919],[6919,7385],[7385,7541],[7541,8318],[8318,9640]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Orange is the pawpaw, ripe and sweet.\nScoop it with a spoon, a juicy treat.","sentences":["Orange is the pawpaw, ripe and sweet.","Scoop it with a spoon, a juicy treat."],"alt":"A sliced pawpaw with orange flesh.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d448fbc0a34ba8799c87217fbe03f7aea372e0026e9184b3d52499a86c35972